{"method":{"methodHash":"a51718bf2ee8b0d443544beb334c61e0","typeHash":"e4a6a66cfe6c7304f91b9ce2765912cc","name":"BuildLowestResourceFpsCap","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/AILogic/PerformanceBenchmark.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":571,"startColumn":9,"endLine":596,"endColumn":10},"calls":[{"span":{"startLine":577,"startColumn":35,"endLine":577,"endColumn":83},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Max"},{"span":{"startLine":577,"startColumn":47,"endLine":577,"endColumn":82},"calleeMethodHash":"bed5d54a7a8f8f5dd67168e4669326ba","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.AILogic.PerformanceRecommendationBuilder.RoundDownToNearestFive(double)"},{"span":{"startLine":587,"startColumn":26,"endLine":587,"endColumn":136},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Min"},{"span":{"startLine":587,"startColumn":43,"endLine":587,"endColumn":135},"calleeMethodHash":"bed5d54a7a8f8f5dd67168e4669326ba","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.AILogic.PerformanceRecommendationBuilder.RoundDownToNearestFive(double)"},{"span":{"startLine":592,"startColumn":26,"endLine":592,"endColumn":136},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Min"},{"span":{"startLine":592,"startColumn":43,"endLine":592,"endColumn":135},"calleeMethodHash":"bed5d54a7a8f8f5dd67168e4669326ba","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.AILogic.PerformanceRecommendationBuilder.RoundDownToNearestFive(double)"},{"span":{"startLine":595,"startColumn":20,"endLine":595,"endColumn":71},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Min"},{"span":{"startLine":595,"startColumn":29,"endLine":595,"endColumn":53},"calleeMethodHash":"671e30f487fffd6eeb178108608aef38","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.AILogic.PerformanceRecommendationBuilder.Clamp(int, int, int)"}]},"lines":["        private static int BuildLowestResourceFpsCap(PerformanceBenchmarkSizeResult result)","        {","            double measuredFps = result.AverageFps;","            if (measuredFps \u003C= 0)","                return 30;","","            int measuredCeiling = Math.Max(5, RoundDownToNearestFive(measuredFps));","            int floor = measuredFps \u003E= 30 ? 30 : 5;","            int target = measuredFps \u003E= 60","                ? 60","                : measuredFps \u003E= 30","                    ? 30","                    : measuredCeiling;","","            if (result.GpuAvailable \u0026\u0026 result.AverageGpuPercent \u003E LowResourceTargetGpuPercent)","            {","                target = Math.Min(target, RoundDownToNearestFive(measuredFps * LowResourceTargetGpuPercent / result.AverageGpuPercent));","            }","","            if (result.AverageCpuPercent \u003E LowResourceTargetCpuPercent)","            {","                target = Math.Min(target, RoundDownToNearestFive(measuredFps * LowResourceTargetCpuPercent / result.AverageCpuPercent));","            }","","            return Math.Min(Clamp(target, floor, 60), measuredCeiling);","        }"],"startLine":571}